      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I have accepted the quote from Watters. I did get quotes from Smart Energy (too expensive and tried to sell me a much more sophisticated system than I needed), also from Greenhouse solar and Electrical.  They were very good - excellent customer service, and very similar quote to Watters, but they were just edged out by Watters - a well respected, long standing local company.I expect the installation to begin very soon.  Everything was delayed by my having to get approval from the Body Corporate of the Retirement Village in live in.Too early to correctly rate the installation and quality fo the system.  It's not installed yet. But there were no other options so I've given everything tick!",
